from two filed figures).","cites":["P.rpo.2026","P.rpo.2025","P.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.2 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $954 million a year earlier.","cites":["P.deferred.2026","P.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 6,400 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $572,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["P.q.employees","P.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $855 million in cash and cash equivalents and $692 million in short-term investments. No debt is tagged under the tags read here.","cites":["P.cash.2026","P.sti.2026"]}]},"fin":{"P":{}},"quotes":{"P.q.employees":{"c":"P","kind":"employees","n":6400,"quote":"We employ approximately 6,400 employees globally - approximately 3,700 in the U.S. and over 2,700 internationally at the end of fiscal 2026.","source":"P-0001474432-26-000027","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-03-25","proof":"bd6210a4bd4c43a93f3c6c511e6b3cafd936455de0ff1d81e01a28c17afde97e"}}}